  STRUCT('VOYAGE CARE', '02215899', 'accepted', DATE '2026-09-24', 'TIER B, USER DECISION on the batch-2 escalations, 2026-09-24. ACCEPT THE BUYER-STATED ALTERNATIVE 02215899 (the demoted tier-1 candidate) over the tier-4 candidate 04250960. Confidence Medium. Basis: York\'s payments are care fees; 02215899 VOYAGE 1 LIMITED is the group\'s care-operating company (SIC 87200) and one award states it. The tier-4 candidate VOYAGE CARE LIMITED is the head-office company. A same-group choice between the operator and its parent. GBP 1,167,058.07.'),
