  STRUCT('OVE ARUP AND PARTNERS', '01312453', 'accepted', DATE '2026-09-30', 'TIER A, USER DECISION, 2026-09-30. Accept 01312453 OVE ARUP & PARTNERS LIMITED for GBP 10,684,378.79. Basis: the Department for Transport publication pays a related spelling, OVE ARUP AND PARTNERS LTD, which resolves by rule at tier 2, high confidence, to 01312453; 38 Contracts Finder awards under this name state 01312453, against 1 stating 00952468 (a plain-name award, the tier-1 conflict source) and 2 stating 09938540 OVE ARUP LIMITED under the name Ove Arup & Partners Ltd (name and number disagree); National Highways own awards name Ove Arup & Partners Limited or Ltd and never International. QUALIFICATION, stated by the user: the related-spelling bridge crosses paying bodies inside the DfT publication (High Speed Two (HS2) Limited 52 rows, Department for Transport 65 rows, EWR 20 rows) and is not a pure National Highways self-bridge -- National Highways pays the queued spelling (92.85% of the value) and never the Ltd spelling; the City of York residual (7.15%, GBP 763,606.15) has no bridge of its own. A row-specific decision: it creates no evidence class, delegation, D.10 or stale-guard change.'),
