  STRUCT('PRICEWATERHOUSE COOPERS LLP', 'OC303525', 'accepted', DATE '2026-09-30', 'TIER A, USER DECISION, 2026-09-30, row-specific. Accept OC303525 PRICEWATERHOUSECOOPERS LLP for GBP 13,086,655.57. A demoted tier-1 row: the payer writes PRICEWATERHOUSE COOPERS LLP, the register holds PRICEWATERHOUSECOOPERS LLP -- one space, a word-split normalisation artefact, not a different firm. Basis: all 54 payments come from one body in the DfT publication, High Speed Two (HS2) Limited, and that body own Contracts Finder award states OC303525 for PricewaterhouseCoopers LLP; 43 awards state OC303525, including under the split spelling; Bristol City Council, HM Revenue and Customs, Ministry of Justice pay PRICEWATERHOUSECOOPERS LLP, which resolves by rule at tier 2 to OC303525 -- a cross-payer bridge, not the same-payer class. Decided per row by the user: it does not expand the payer-awards class, authorise the bridge-scope audit, widen Tier A approval, or change D.10, delegation or the stale guard.'),
