  STRUCT('ETM CONTRACTORS LTD', '02970707', 'accepted', DATE '2026-09-30', 'TIER A, USER DECISION, 2026-09-30, row-specific. Accept 02970707 E T M CONTRACTORS LIMITED for GBP 12,090,246.00. A demoted tier-1 row: the register holds E T M CONTRACTORS LIMITED, the payer writes ETM CONTRACTORS LTD -- register-side spacing, not a different company. Basis: all 363 payments come from Bristol City Council and total the queue value; they are coded mainly to roads and highways work (GBP 6,625,338.59, 54.80%, in coding groups naming carriageways, highways, footways, traffic, junctions, transport, drainage or bridges; 31 groups in all); a North Somerset Council award to ETM Contractors Limited states 02970707, and no award states another number. Disclosed: the Bristol award to ETM Contractors carries no company number, and no payment carries a postcode. Decided per row by the user: no normalisation rule, evidence class, delegation, D.10 or payer-awards scope change; the register-side spacing trigger gap stays open.'),
