  STRUCT('MENCAP', '00889191', 'rejected', DATE '2026-09-30', 'TIER A, USER DECISION, 2026-09-30, row-specific. Reject 00889191 MENCAP LIMITED; the name stays unresolved and GBP 10,539,075.78 stays unresolved. The tier-4 score of 1 rests on the one word MENCAP, which 77 entries in the candidate universe carry. No award states 00889191. The numbered award evidence points to a different sibling company: 3 of 12 awards naming Royal Mencap Society state 00550457, which shares its registered postcode with 00889191. All 1,979 payments come from City of York Council. Decided per row by the user: it does not authorise substituting 00550457, create a dormant or wrong-entity rejection class, or change the stale guard.'),
