  STRUCT('CARTER JONAS', '06287947', 'rejected', DATE '2026-09-30', 'TIER A, USER DECISION, 2026-09-30, row-specific. Reject 06287947 CARTER JONAS LIMITED; the name stays unresolved and GBP 10,061,631.90 stays unresolved. The offered candidate is a declared dormant company (SIC 99999) whose offer came from a company-number tie-break between the 2 companies that reduce to CARTER JONAS; no award states 06287947. All 55 payments come from High Speed Two (HS2) Limited. The identity evidence for OC304417 CARTER JONAS LLP was reviewed, but recording it is not authorised: no stale-guard or D.10 exception is granted, and no substitute candidate is recorded.')
